/*
 * Mars Lander - Camera + WiFi TCP + HTTP + IMU + Ultrasonic + Actuators
 * 800x800 RGB565 → 灰度 → JPEG → WiFi → PC
 * 三缓冲 + TCP + HTTP server
 */

